                {
                  "type": "HTML",
                  "content": "&nbsp;Mix 30g (approx. 1 scoop) with 250ml of water or milk, consume 30 minutes before and/or after exercise. Powder settles over time, we recommend weighing for the most accurate measure.&nbsp;"
